<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan condemned a Houthi strike on the Saudi Aramco building and demanded an end to Houthi attacks on Saudi Arabia. In Balochistan a precision strike killed nine BLA terrorists, including a commander, while a drone operation in Punjab dropped pistols, cartridges and heroin near the border. Security forces arrested multiple suspects in Lahore, Sargodha, Multan and near the Pakistan border after shootings, a marriage-proposal dispute and a major arms haul involving RPG launchers, pistols and drugs. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBNZzNQclRGYW16U1BnbUJVLUdobjVKX0stSHhnQl9obnZnYUdLMWFkaUlhSV9IbFlXaTQ1SVd1TjNlcHpPdXJKOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQYmhoS052azdTaW41T2QwODctdW9XNzZCSE1RUUkyRW1DQXhXQkYxX3JnOHNfVml6TkswWEctZ25paTE0RkFmNVE4TXE5eWxORHdpdXp2QkU4QzdkNThBUlUydHMzUjBJNFpfT1Q1ZEFmeGFUZm1rLTBMd201QXpMUk5GSFBVY1lQakJ0SEpza2FISmJBaHBfMWdDbkdNNERPOFUzcFVNQjRaUE5vcGstTGNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pakistan Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQdGhhc2ZNT3A0WFd6UnZlclc3aEY1R3ZoMkM1Qi1TUzBpSzlEVzRwU3ZJTEM1Y1ZsUnVrRUFqcjg1anZxNERqb09Xa1VhN2JZSVh6WDJVenR3OWNKSHJFTFRKbEk3OGg0UHJwVTJ4bG95T3psS3JsZE01VGI1bzh3cmlTaDhJb2FqUjRfZl9qSXgtWVBoMVYwTFl2OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UrduPoint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOSDNTanVsNy1Od3UzWEdKTlhveGZjY0M5a2NQSjdKZ2tyU1U0OEVKdEgzM3pzSE9hbTIzMFp3cUJXb2JMQjhuVXR2RFBaMGlGajRhVzBRc1lnR25vQ18wWkxCYTZYRzByNUZhZ3M3eXdIQkQ3dUszd0xhLWh0WU56c050dXREdWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;UrduPoint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiw